sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform UI
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Webhook as Trainer Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant JobSetAPI as JobSet API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant JobSetCtrl as JobSet Controller
    participant Pods as Training Pods<br/>(NCCL/MPI/gRPC)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,Pods: Flow 1: TrainJob Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: 1. Create TrainJob CR<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: 2. Admission Review<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS (self-signed)<br/>Auth: API Server TLS client
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation Result (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created

    Note over Controller: Controller watches TrainJob CRs

    Controller->>K8sAPI: 3. Get TrainJob + resolve Runtime<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: TrainJob + TrainingRuntime spec

    Controller->>JobSetAPI: 4. Create JobSet from Runtime template<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodGroup (if gang-scheduling)<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS

    Note over Controller: RHAI: Create NetworkPolicy for pod isolation
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>(allows same-job pods + controller metrics)

    JobSetCtrl->>K8sAPI: 5. Create Jobs and Pods<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over Pods: 6. Training pods communicate peer-to-peer
    Pods->>Pods: NCCL AllReduce / MPI / gRPC<br/>29500/TCP plaintext<br/>NetworkPolicy restricted

    Note over Controller,Pods: Flow 2: Progression Tracking (RHAI)

    loop Every 30s (configurable 5-300s)
        Controller->>Pods: 1. GET /metrics (rank 0 pod)<br/>HTTP/28080 plaintext<br/>Auth: None (NetworkPolicy restricted)
        Pods-->>Controller: progressPercentage, steps,<br/>epochs, estimatedTimeRemaining
        Controller->>K8sAPI: 2. PATCH TrainJob annotation<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end

    Note over Pods: Training completes
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Read pod termination message<br/>(final training metrics)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update TrainJob status → Succeeded

    Note over Controller,Prometheus: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>Controller: Scrape /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443 TLS 1.2+<br/>PodMonitor (RHOAI)
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Controller metrics
